              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BOOKMARKER"
            },
            "reviewBody": "6.20.20 ... https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/176497/chili-taco-popcorn/ ... This looked good, but wasn't impressive-tasting. I like the idea, but using homemade blends rather than storebought - because of the fillers &amp; thickening agents - could very well be the way to go. Giving it 4 stars because E, 23, liked.",
